<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - July 16.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - July 16.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     RIC	Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Mt Leyshon Gold	15.63    1.60</p>
<p> 2   Cudgen R.Z.	    10.42    2.40</p>
<p> 3   Natl Consol	     9.57    0.94</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.38    0.80</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	 9.18    1.06</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 9.09    1.11</p>
<p> 7   BT Prop Trust	   8.54    1.91</p>
<p> 8   Indu Property	   8.41    1.01</p>
<p> 9   Davids Limited	  8.33    1.20</p>
<p>10   Sea World Prop	  8.15    1.46</p>
<p>11   Centro Prop	     8.09    2.38</p>
<p>12   Colonial Mutual	 8.08    1.32</p>
<p>13   Countrywide-PP	  7.94    1.28</p>
<p>14   Villa World	     7.94    1.26</p>
<p>15   Equitilink		7.94    0.63</p>
<p>16   Colonial Coml	   7.80    2.37</p>
<p>17   Schroder Prop	   7.71    2.40</p>
<p>18   Gen Prop Tr	     7.67    2.62</p>
<p>19   Ipoh			7.63    2.36</p>
<p>20   Armstrong Retail	7.61    0.87</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
